2026-07-27T07:43:27.2438747Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2484563Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2485297Z i /tmp/RtmpDdJ4ZA/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2485841Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2486352Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2487135Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2487919Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2488877Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2489714Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2696454Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:43:27.2794548Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:43:27.3142985Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:43:27.3263461Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
